3784
03:15:38,860 --> 03:15:39,300
It's this way.

3785
03:15:43,050 --> 03:15:44,590
I may cross some land, actually.

3786
03:15:45,090 --> 03:15:46,690
Just take a bit of a different path home.

3787
03:15:49,990 --> 03:15:50,390
Yeah...

3788
03:15:50,390 --> 03:15:50,510
Yeah.

3789
03:15:50,990 --> 03:15:51,270
That's good.

3790
03:15:56,700 --> 03:15:58,360
Could do with some more coal as well.

3791
03:16:01,470 --> 03:16:03,810
Oh man, I completely forgot to take breaks as well.

3792
