What if I aggro them while on the water?

3839
03:18:45,720 --> 03:18:46,040
Sir?

3840
03:18:49,780 --> 03:18:50,480
Okay, he's mad.

3841
03:18:51,180 --> 03:18:52,520
But he can't get to me.

3842
03:18:53,280 --> 03:18:53,740
