3847
03:19:16,100 --> 03:19:20,080
You know, that's kind of a legit strategy.

3848
03:19:20,340 --> 03:19:26,720
If you're being chased by an Enderman and you don't have a weapon or a shield, or an EDP, jump in a boat.

3849
03:19:27,100 --> 03:19:28,900
And just sail the F away.

3850
03:19:32,280 --> 03:19:33,660
Oh, hold on!

3851
03:19:34,840 --> 03:19:36,200
Excuse me, Mr. Stewart.

3852
03:19:36,220 --> 03:19:37,400
