Oh, I see him.

3857
03:19:50,500 --> 03:19:50,860
He's down there.

3858
03:19:50,940 --> 03:19:51,420
Is he the bubbles?

3859
03:19:54,470 --> 03:19:55,350
Where's my money at?

3860
03:19:59,030 --> 03:20:00,270
He spit at the zombie!

3861
03:20:01,990 --> 03:20:02,550
Funny.

3862
