Um, I don't want this right now.

3863
03:20:07,730 --> 03:20:09,510
Give me my gold.

3864
03:20:10,130 --> 03:20:10,410
Now!

3865
03:20:11,290 --> 03:20:11,790
Stewart!

3866
03:20:13,050 --> 03:20:14,710
Could I purchase something?

3867
03:20:16,990 --> 03:20:18,550
How about I get some...

3868
03:20:20,530 --> 03:20:21,470
Grey dye.

3869
03:20:28,970 --> 03:20:30,370
I'll take that, thank you.

3870
03:20:41,220 --> 03:20:42,660
Why didn't I have a shield on?!

3871
03:20:46,320 --> 03:20:46,940
Exquisite me!

3872
03:20:53,420 --> 03:20:54,280
Uh, no, no, no.

3873
03:20:54,920 --> 03:20:55,560
I'm out of here.

3874
03:20:56,300 --> 03:20:57,060
Stewart, see you later.

3875
03:20:57,760 --> 03:20:58,540
It was good chatting.

3876
03:20:59,360 --> 03:21:00,100
But I gotta go.

3877
03:21:00,320 --> 03:21:01,400
Have fun with that creeper.

3878
03:21:02,980 --> 03:21:03,640
Bye-bye now!

3879
03:21:05,260 --> 03:21:07,700
Now that is the weird island, which means Major Crimes Division.

3880
03:21:08,380 --> 03:21:09,400
Here, that way, left.

3881
03:21:11,860 --> 03:21:12,680
Eat the steak.

3882
03:21:18,890 --> 03:21:26,750
I wonder if there's a mechanic in this game where if you hold something in your hand, like, the heart of the sea, if enemies will be, uh, threatened by it.

3883
03:21:27,290 --> 03:21:28,450
And just leave.

3884
03:21:29,150 --> 03:21:30,430
You know, like, they're scared of it.

3885
03:21:30,530 --> 03:21:31,190
Think of the mummy.

3886
03:21:31,550 --> 03:21:38,310
And the way that coward, uh, cowardly character was holding up all kinds of religious, uh, symbols.

3887
03:21:39,170 --> 03:21:40,330
Until one of them worked.

3888
03:21:41,510 --> 03:21:42,970
It's like garlic and vampires.

3889
03:21:43,910 --> 03:21:48,910
You know, what if I hold up the heart of the sea, and the enemies will just, sort of, run.

3890
03:21:49,370 --> 03:21:50,610
Or swim away, you know?

3891
03:21:51,470 --> 03:21:53,710
You're like, oh shit, that dude has a heart of the sea.

3892
03:21:53,850 --> 03:21:54,970
We don't, we're not gonna mess with him.

3893
03:21:56,750 --> 03:21:57,710
That sort of deal, you know?

3894
03:22:04,170 --> 03:22:04,750
That's lovely.

3895
03:22:06,890 --> 03:22:09,630
You know what, I actually kinda like the way that tree looks from this angle here.

3896
03:22:10,430 --> 03:22:14,430
It's like a little, uh, front yard tree in a way.

3897
03:22:15,410 --> 03:22:17,210
I think I like this tree, I'm gonna keep it.

3898
03:22:19,790 --> 03:22:20,130
Yeah.

3899
03:22:22,210 --> 03:22:23,230
It's a decent tree.

3900
03:22:28,610 --> 03:22:31,010
Ooh, you know what, another thing I wanna try while I'm here.

3901
03:22:32,030 --> 03:22:33,070
Um, doo doo doo.

3902
03:22:33,270 --> 03:22:34,550
Let's just get rid of one, one arrow.

3903
03:22:35,770 --> 03:22:38,310
I wanna try these sweet berries and a potion!

3904
03:22:38,710 --> 03:22:40,230
Can't believe I didn't think about that before.

3905
03:22:40,430 --> 03:22:41,610
You know what, the boat can stay.

3906
03:22:44,940 --> 03:22:47,460
I actually have my pockets so full of items.

3907
03:22:47,740 --> 03:22:49,180
Like, four full pouches.

3908
03:22:49,920 --> 03:22:51,860
And a full inventory as well.

3909
03:22:52,500 --> 03:22:54,380
It doesn't get more complete than that.

3910
03:22:55,040 --> 03:22:56,640
I'm bringing home the bacon.

3911
03:22:57,680 --> 03:22:58,900
And boy is it good.

3912
03:22:59,460 --> 03:23:01,200
