3914
03:23:04,950 --> 03:23:05,840
It's exciting!

3915
03:23:08,880 --> 03:23:10,960
My first time enchanting in this world.

3916
03:23:12,160 --> 03:23:13,700
It's kind of a big deal, guys.

3917
03:23:23,000 --> 03:23:23,260
Meh.

3918
