3923
03:23:48,440 --> 03:23:50,600
Everyone gets to be invisible but me!

3924
03:23:52,120 --> 03:23:54,440
I gotta find the recipe for that potion, man.

3925
03:23:55,320 --> 03:23:56,620
Even the spiders are drinking!

3926
03:23:57,420 --> 03:23:58,700
I gotta get in on that.

3927
03:24:00,920 --> 03:24:01,700
God damn.

3928
03:24:06,310 --> 03:24:08,130
Kinda funny that I could see its eyes, though.

3929
03:24:08,690 --> 03:24:10,490
Like, everything but its eyes was invisible.

3930
03:24:14,160 --> 03:24:15,180
Home sweet home!

3931
