I'm not your papa, though.

3935
03:24:26,240 --> 03:24:26,620
Fuck off.

3936
03:24:27,260 --> 03:24:28,780
Attack children are not welcome.

3937
03:24:29,100 --> 03:24:30,220
I should have a sign out front.

3938
03:24:30,920 --> 03:24:32,300
Let's play some soothing music.

3939
03:24:40,330 --> 03:24:41,650
It's time to enchant.

3940
03:24:43,390 --> 03:24:45,890
I have come home from a long and arduous journey.

3941
03:24:46,070 --> 03:24:47,410
And boy, did I bring some goodies.

3942
03:24:48,750 --> 03:24:50,310
Stuff from far away lands.

3943
03:24:50,530 --> 03:24:51,270
Exotic lands.

3944
03:24:51,550 --> 03:24:52,670
All the different lands.

3945
03:24:53,470 --> 03:24:54,670
I have big plans.

3946
03:24:55,510 --> 03:24:56,630
Let me see your hands.

3947
03:24:56,890 --> 03:24:57,590
Why are they dirty?

3948
03:24:57,670 --> 03:24:58,710
What did you do this morning?

3949
03:24:59,830 --> 03:25:02,490
Didn't I tell you not to go play in the yard, you sicko?

3950
03:25:02,630 --> 03:25:03,550
Wait, where do these go?

3951
03:25:04,790 --> 03:25:06,730
Right, I'm trying them with the potions.

3952
03:25:08,690 --> 03:25:09,550
In they go.

3953
03:25:09,730 --> 03:25:10,450
